<title>MOROCCO: Commodities fund to hold Latin American workshop.</title>
<headline>Commodities fund to hold Latin American workshop.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Common Fund for Commodities is to hold a workshop next June on development of commodities in Latin America and the Caribbean, the official Moroccan news agency MAP said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The workshop was agreed at a meeting of the Fund's governing council now taking place in the Moroccan city of Marrakesh.</p>
<p>The venue was not given. The workshop follows one held in Abidjan last July on African commodities.</p>
</text>
